@startuml
title FHIR-ressurser for å finne forskningsstudier
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class ResearchStudy {
    +title : string
    +status : code
    +sponsor : Reference(Organization)
    +site : Reference(Organization)
    +enrollment : Reference(Group)
}

class Group {
    +type : code
    +membership : code
    +characteristic : kriterier
}

class Organization {
    +name : string
}

class Location {
    +address : Address
    +position : coordinates
}

class Questionnaire
class QuestionnaireResponse {
    +answer : user data
}

class Patient
class Condition
class Observation
class MedicationStatement

ResearchStudy --> Organization : site (0..*)
ResearchStudy --> Group : enrollment (0..*)
Location --> Organization : managingOrganization (0..1)
Questionnaire "1" --> "0..*" QuestionnaireResponse : collects answers
QuestionnaireResponse --> Patient : subject (0..1)
Condition --> Patient : subject
Observation --> Patient : subject (0..1)
MedicationStatement --> Patient : subject

note bottom of Group
    Inclusion and exclusion criteria
    can be evaluated individually.
end note

note bottom of Patient
    Use only the data needed
    for preliminary matching.
end note
@enduml